        "description": "Severe feeding difficulties requiring gastrostomy",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of severe neonatal hypotonia and developmental delay, characteristic MRI findings of pontocerebellar hypoplasia, and confirmation of biallelic TSEN54 pathogenic variants",
